################################################################
# Phenologs run data / experiment outputs -- NEVER commit these.
# The pipeline writes multi-GB KG dumps, randomized trials and
# results into the project dir passed via -p / params. Ignore the
# default project dir and every subdirectory the pipeline creates,
# at any depth, so a run under a differently-named -p is also safe.
################################################################

# Default project dir created by nextflow/modules/01_get_data.nf
phenologs-from-kg/

# Subdirectories created by python/01_download_and_setup.py
monarch_kg/
species_data/
random_trials/
phenologs_results/
leave_one_out_xvalidation/

# Bulk KG / ontology artifacts
monarch-kg.tar.gz
monarch-kg_*.tsv
phenio-relation-graph.gz

# Nextflow run state and reports
work/
.nextflow/
.nextflow.log*
report.html
timeline.html
trace.txt
dag.dot
dag.html

# Apptainer/Singularity image
*.sif

# The kg slices under test_data/ are the one place kg files are tracked
!test_data/*/monarch_kg/
!test_data/*/monarch_kg/*
